1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:05,103
If you were born as Lucia Caminos, you'd go to
prison for fighting for your family.

2
00:00:05,703 --> 00:00:10,068
Then you'd walk out on pure luck, and straight
into the car of a guy you barely know.

3
00:00:10,668 --> 00:00:15,451
And together, the two of you would rob your way
across the whole state of Leonida.

4
00:00:16,051 --> 00:00:16,910
But right now?

5
00:00:17,084 --> 00:00:18,779
You're a baby in Liberty
City.

6
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:19,638
No record.

7
00:00:19,789 --> 00:00:20,440
No gun.

8
00:00:20,765 --> 00:00:22,320
Not even teeth.

9
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,603
Your mom has big dreams.

10
00:00:24,685 --> 00:00:25,544
Not for her.

11
00:00:25,927 --> 00:00:26,670
For you.

12
00:00:27,181 --> 00:00:28,121
A good life.

13
00:00:28,504 --> 00:00:29,398
Sunshine.

14
00:00:29,909 --> 00:00:31,616
Somewhere far away from
here.

15
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,880
Remember that dream.

16
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,059
Your dad has a different
plan.

17
00:00:36,233 --> 00:00:39,496
You can barely walk, and he's
already teaching you to fight.

18
00:00:40,096 --> 00:00:40,723
Hands up.

19
00:00:40,769 --> 00:00:41,396
Chin down.

20
00:00:41,431 --> 00:00:42,139
Hit back.

21
00:00:42,464 --> 00:00:43,951
Remember that, too.

22
00:00:44,551 --> 00:00:46,931
By seven, you're the kid
nobody messes with.

23
00:00:47,372 --> 00:00:48,522
Bigger kids try.

24
00:00:48,847 --> 00:00:49,892
Once.

25
00:00:50,492 --> 00:00:52,094
Life keeps coming at you
swinging.

26
00:00:52,373 --> 00:00:53,453
So you swing back.

27
00:00:53,569 --> 00:00:54,857
Every single time.

28
00:00:55,457 --> 00:00:57,338
Then the Liberty City
days are over.

29
00:00:57,431 --> 00:00:58,754
Your family heads south.

30
00:00:59,079 --> 00:00:59,892
Way south.

31
00:01:00,171 --> 00:01:02,051
All the way down to
Leonida.

